    "composer.queueSteerTooltip" : {
      "comment" : "Agent pane: tooltip of the Send button while a turn runs, for an agent that takes a prompt mid-turn, when Settings > Follow-Up Messages is Queue; Return queues the prompt behind the turn, Command-Return steers the turn with it (the agent reads it when its current step ends). Keep the ↵ and ⌘↵ key symbols.",
